OL,3,GNEWSACollege may need to return funds
OL,4,Aafter probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sheffield College could be forced
OL,7,Fto pay back part of its funding amid an
OL,8,Finvestigation into allegations of
OL,9,Fmaladministration.
OL,11,FAn external audit is under way looking
OL,12,Finto the college's provision for people
OL,13,Flearning English as a foreign language.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,16,FAuthority (SYMCA) provides #11.6m each
OL,17,Fyear for adult skills at the college
OL,18,Fand launched an investigation last year
OL,19,Finto potential fraud after it was
OL,20,Fflagged up by auditors, however no
OL,21,Ffraud has been found at this time.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
